   "texts": [
    "The old man was just carrying a pig on his way home",
    "But was stopped by a group of armed boy scouts",
    "The leader of the group was very unreasonable",
    "He insisted",
    "That the pig was stolen by the old man",
    "He wanted to confiscate it",
    "Facing the muzzle of the gun",
    "To save his life",
    "The old man had to painfully let go of the only valuable property in the house",
    "You bastard",
    "You bastard",
    "You bastard",
    "You damn",
    "The boy excitedly carried the pig onto the car",
    "Among the cheers of his companions",
    "He shouted and moved forward",
    "Then the boy scout team",
    "Headed towards their final destination",
    "But they had only gone halfway",
    "They were ambushed",
    "Johnny got out of the car",
    "He commanded his men to search",
    "They only found",
    "A gun and a boy crouching",
    "Johnny was sure it was the enemy",
    "He ordered his men to strip the boy",
    "And tie his hands behind his back",
    "The boy was surrounded and beaten by the group",
    "He was shaking with fear",
    "He struggled to escape",
    "The outcome was predictable",
    "The car was damaged",
    "The group had to proceed on foot",
    "But they hadn't gone far",
    "They were attacked again",
    "The boy scouts dispersed",
    "Each finding a place to hide",
    "Little Pink didn't move",
    "He was so scared that he didn't know what to do",
    "Through the direction of the gunfire",
    "They quickly located the enemy's position",
    "Johnny commanded his men to suppress the enemy with firepower",
    "While taking the opportunity",
    "强尼指挥手下一边进行火力压制",
    "一边趁机"
   ]
